WEBVTT

00:08:56.912 --> 00:09:00.496
is only really working for an increasingly
smaller group of folks.

00:09:01.871 --> 00:09:05.371
But when the people who are benefiting
from this legacy of stolen land

00:09:05.371 --> 00:09:06.787
step forward,

00:09:06.829 --> 00:09:08.579
real change can happen.

00:09:09.037 --> 00:09:12.621
This isn't just an opportunity
to right a past injustice.

00:09:12.954 --> 00:09:15.037
It's the only way to heal the land itself.

00:09:15.704 --> 00:09:19.079
And that means
a better future for everyone.

00:09:19.704 --> 00:09:20.912
Thank you.

00:09:20.912 --> 00:09:22.537
(Applause)